[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2487820570","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99435#issuecomment-2487820570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99435","id":2487820570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6USSEa","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-20T08:03:28Z","updated_at":"2024-11-20T08:03:28Z","body":"`Task` is not a [Variant-compatible type](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_variant.html#variant-compatible-types). Removing this check would mean you'd run into issues when trying to use the type as a `Variant` (i.e.: trying to use `Task` with some Godot API).\n\nThe exception only seems harmless to you because you are not using the `Variant` returned from the `Callable.Call` invocation. The value returned from the `Callable`'s delegate must be converted to `Variant` so it can be returned, but if the value can't be converted it throws. If the conversion didn't throw for incompatible values, we'd be potentially hiding a bug in your code.\n\nSince you are not awaiting the returned `Task`, it sounds like you really just want an `async void` method here:\n\n```csharp\nCallable.From(async void () =>\n{\n    GD.Print(\"Waiting for delay\");\n    await ToSignal(GetTree().CreateTimer(1), \"timeout\");\n    GD.Print(\"Delay complete\");\n}).Call();\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2487820570/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2489173950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99435#issuecomment-2489173950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99435","id":2489173950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UXce-","user":{"login":"HeySora","id":17962248,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTYyMjQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17962248?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora","html_url":"https://github.com/HeySora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeySora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-20T17:27:28Z","updated_at":"2024-11-20T17:27:28Z","body":"Oh wow; I completely forgot that async void lambdas were supported on .NET 6. Thank you for this solution, it's exactly what this use-case needs.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2489173950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]